00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Cuelira. Your scene responds to you.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
When I rehearse alone, a recorded line cannot respond to my performance.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,000
I choose camera measurement. Video recording has separate consent.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:31,000
SmartSpectra face metrics validate the performed cue before Rowan answers.

5
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:02,000
The final cue requires a deliberate return toward neutral, after a non-neutral expression.

6
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:20,000
The review keeps accepted SDK observations and manual continuations distinct.

7
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,000
The observation, validation and scene transition are inspectable in the repository.

8
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,000
One scene. My choices. A take I can learn from. Cuelira.
